        "code": "% Teste: tree_sum de [5, [3, [1, [], []], []], [2, [], []]]\n%       5\n%      / \\\n%     3   2\n%    /\n%   1\n\\+ \\+ (\n    tree_sum([5, [3, [1, [], []], []], [2, [], []]], _Sum),\n    format('Tree sum: ~w (expected 11)~n', [_Sum])\n).",
        "type": "code",
